x13 WE_N WDI_EDGE VDD VSS sg13g2_inv_1
x14 net2 DIS RESET VDD VSS sg13g2_nor2_2
x15 RSD RESET Q10_N HIT VDD VSS sg13g2_a21o_1
x16 RESET RS_N CLK RSD POR_B VDD VSS sg13g2_dfrbp_2
**.ends

